<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of four-day</p>
<p>Supersport Series cricket matches which ended on Monday:</p>
<p>In Kimberley: Free State 493, Griqualand West 340 and 222-6</p>
<p>(M.Gidley 76 not out). Match drawn.</p>
<p>In Johannesburg: Transvaal 334 and 272-3 dec, Eastern</p>
<p>Province 261 and 185 (L.Koen 75; C.Eksteen 4-74). Transvaal won</p>
<p>by 160 runs.</p>
</text>
